From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 14 Jun 2026 21:02:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: convert ox_banking to full QBX replacement for
 Renewed-Banking

- Add src/server/qbx_compat.lua: qb-management & esx_society backwards
  compatibility exports using ox_banking's accounts table; auto-creates
  group accounts for all QBX jobs/gangs on startup; /givecash command
- Add src/client/qbx_peds.lua: NPC peds at all Renewed-Banking bank
  locations with ox_target support; driven by QBCore:Client events and
  isLoggedIn state bag
- Add data/peds.json: bank ped locations ported from Renewed-Banking
- Update data/config.json: add UsePeds toggle (default true)
- Update scripts/build.js: include new Lua files in fxmanifest, remove
  hard ox_inventory dependency, append provide 'qb-management' and
  provide 'esx_society' declarations post-build
- Update src/client/index.ts: make ox_inventory optional; fall back to
  qbx_core/qb-core for cash; listen to QBCore:Client:OnPlayerData for
  real-time cash refresh

